#: /Users/thopayto/Projects/splunkcore-web-ui/web_v2/search_mrsparkle/exposed/js/views/field_extractor/FieldExtractorMaster.js:1599 
msgid ""
"If you see incorrect results below, click an additional event to add it "
"to the set of sample events. Highlight its values to improve the "
