#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:2470 
msgid ""
"Number of initial clusters to use.  If specified as a range, clustering "
"will be performed for each \\\n"
"count of clusters in the range, and a summary of the result of each run "
"will be provided expressing \\\n"
"the size of the clusters, and the 'distortion', which describes a kind of"
" non-fittedness of the data. \\\n"
"Distortion is the sum of the squared distances between each item and its "
"cluster center."
msgstr ""
"Anfänglich zu verwendende Anzahl von Clustern. Wird hier ein Bereich angegeben, wird das Clustering für jede \\\n"
