#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:6725 
msgid ""
"Uses the ingest 'metricschema' processor to build a metrics event out of "
"\\\n"
"sample data. This search first builds a raw event, then mimics the "
"metadata from the \\\n"
"field extractions, and then runs the \"ingestpreview\" command to display"
" the mock \\\n"
"metrics event."
